      "history": "history.write_letters",
      "sources": ["Trekker leaders wrote to the Colony and to the Graham's Town Journal, for example Retief's manifesto of early 1837 (research.md section 2); letters went back with travellers and traders. That trekkers asked English families to write for them is invented."],
