      "sources": ["Retief was chosen governor of the united laagers in April 1837 (17 Apr in Afrikaans sources) and sworn in on 6 Jun 1837; Maritz kept his offices; Potgieter was left without a leading post, and the leaders split over going to Natal or north (Wikipedia, 'Piet Retief'; weet.co.za). Dates [conflict]. The talk at the fire is invented."],
